    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d970">

                <pb facs="0743" n="627" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg627"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13928.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Canova to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Queretaro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-27T20:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 27, 1914, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Gutiérrez is still here, awaiting developments. Villa is expected to
                    enter Mexico City. General Blanco is reported to have withdrawn his troops from
                    Mexico City.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canova</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
